 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Multiplication by $n$ is surjective with finite kernel",
 "statement": "Let $A$ be an abelian variety\nover a field $k$, and let $n\\geq1$. Then the map $[n]$ of\n[def-sc-mult-n] is a surjective homomorphism of\ngroup schemes, and its kernel\n$A[n]$ is a finite group scheme over $k$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-abelian-varieties/sk-prop-av-mult-surjective/lem-sc-mult-n-isogeny.md",
  "place": "node lem-sc-mult-n-isogeny, order 555",
  "external": [
   {
    "document": "Stacks Project",
    "place": "Tag 03RP"
   },
   {
    "document": "Stacks Project",
    "place": "Tag 0BFG"
   }
  ]
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
  "def-sc-mult-n",
  "def-sc-abelian-variety",
  "def-sc-group-scheme"
 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "*Reference: Stacks Project, Groupoid Schemes, Proposition\n39.9.11 (3) and (5), [Tag 03RP](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/03RP), whose proof is Lemma 39.9.8,\n[Tag 0BFG](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0BFG).*\nBy [lem-sc-mult-n-finite-kernel], $[n]$ is a finite homomorphism of group\nschemes and its kernel $A[n]$ is a finite group scheme over $k$.",
   "uses": [
    "lem-sc-mult-n-finite-kernel"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  },
  {
   "text": "*Surjectivity.* The image $H:=[n](A)\\subseteq A$ is a\nclosed subgroup scheme of $A$ by [lem-sc-image-subgroup] (the\nsource $A$ is proper over $k$ and the target $A$ is separated of\nfinite type over $k$), applied to the homomorphism $[n]$ of\n[lem-sc-mult-n-homomorphism]. Since $[n]$ is finite, its fibres\nhave dimension zero, and the dimension formula for the surjective\nmorphism $A\\to H$ gives\n$\\dim H=\\dim A-\\dim A[n]=\\dim A$. Thus $H\\subseteq A$ is a\nclosed subscheme of the irreducible scheme $A$ with\n$\\dim H=\\dim A$; the reduced subscheme\n$H_{\\mathrm{red}}\\subseteq A$ is then a closed subscheme of the\nreduced irreducible scheme $A$ of the same dimension, hence\n$H_{\\mathrm{red}}=A$, and therefore $H=A$. So\n$[n]:A\\to A$ is surjective.",
   "uses": [
    "lem-sc-image-subgroup",
    "lem-sc-mult-n-homomorphism"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
